.TH QUIPU-ACQUIRE-SCOPE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-acquire\-scope \- Report the bounded row and byte scope of a direct\-main acquisition
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu acquire scope\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-source\-store\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-vm\-steps\fR] [\fB\-\-deadline\-ms\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report the bounded row and byte scope of a direct\-main acquisition
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-store\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-max\-vm\-steps\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-deadline\-ms\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
